Source landscape: Abiy Ahmed in Ethiopia during 2023 yields a dense mix of official government/UN materials, human-rights documentation, regional conflict reporting, transitional-justice papers, and a smaller set of specialist security/peace analyses. The main source families are Tigray ceasefire implementation, Amhara state-of-emergency escalation, OLA peace talks, Eritrea/sea-access tensions, Sudan/GERD diplomacy, and transitional-justice/national-dialogue process documents.

